Define the canonical TSSE–AITFE Engine Kernel:
\[
\mathcal{K}_{\text{TSSE–AITFE}} =
\left(
H_{\text{TSSE–AITFE}},\;
\mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE–AITFE}},\;
